{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44978","headline":"酬乌程杨明府华将赴渭北对月见怀 · 皎然","name":"酬乌程杨明府华将赴渭北对月见怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"释印及秋夜，身闲境亦清。\n风襟自潇洒，月意何高明。\n闻说武安君，万里驱妖精。\n开府集秀士，先招士林英。\n晋家用元凯，亦是鲁诸生。\n北望抚长劒，感君知已行。\n边尘昏玉帐，杀气凝金镫。\n大敌折齐俎，一书下聊城。\n翻飞青云路，宿昔沧洲情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44978.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44978","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}